      "content": "\"I appreciate your outstanding track record in client retention and maintaining strong relationships with our key accounts. However, I need to address the recurring issue of punctuality regarding our internal morning stand-up meetings, as reliability here is critical for our team's efficiency. Moving forward, I expect you to arrive on time for these sessions while continuing your exceptional performance in client management. Let's schedule a brief follow-up to discuss a plan to ensure this behavior is corrected consistently.\"",
